            <note corresp="#d35-f2" n="45" xml:id="d35-f2-content">
                <p>For an exchange of communications on this subject between representatives of
                    Chile and the United States at the Third Meeting of the Foreign Ministers of the
                    American Republics, see telegrams No. 52, January 25, 1 p.m., <ref
